Package: ViralExamR
Type: Package
Title: Host-Based Viral Sequence Exam Exercises
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Ria", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "ria@example.org")
Description: Provides a teaching scaffold for choosing a host, loading supplied
    viral sequences, aligning sequences, and summarizing pairwise identity.
    Sequence provenance and exercise content should be reviewed by the instructor.
